      "english": [
        "Naa guri gamyamaina ninu cherutaku",
        "Ee loka natanalu choochi - Nannu murisiponivvaku",
        "Pondhabovu -Bahumaanamunakai",
        "Naa siluvanu moyuchu - Ninu vembadinchedanu !! Yesayya !!"
